    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imbractĕo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inbr-</span></b> ), no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
			in-bracteo, <i>to overlay with
			leafmetal</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">statuas auro imbracteari,</span>”
				<i>be gilded over</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 14, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aereum opus auro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 17, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpora solida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 25, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
